			"notes": "## [1.0.3+1.20.1] — 2026-03-06\n\n### Added\n\n- Option in Shulker Box Tooltip's mod config to disable previews for other container types.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Bug in which mixins were not added thus disabling many features relating to empty item stacks.\n- Edge case in which toolboxes with two stacks >= 1000 had overlapping tooltip text on compact mode.\n\n### Changed\n\n- Switched changelog to [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/) format."
